
                     MACHXL v2.0 RELEASE NOTES
                  =============================

                        Table of Contents
                        -----------------

I.   New in MACHXL version 2.0
II.  System configuration and installation
III. Retargeting 1xx/2xx designs to MACH3xx/4xx
